1273
01:04:45,656 --> 01:04:48,290
(Mendengus KERAS)
Maaf pak.

1274
01:04:48,292 --> 01:04:51,026
Ayo ayo,
Ayo ayo.

1275
01:04:51,028 --> 01:04:54,196
Benar, Bough.
Misi kami di sini sederhana.

1276
01:04:54,198 --> 01:04:57,600
Dapatkan akses ke kamar tidur Volta
